# Elegy Acolyte's Void: "a nonland permanent left the battlefield this turn" includes a token (a token is a permanent, and it
# leaves the battlefield before ceasing to exist, CR 111.7, 400.7). Turn 3 Bot1 casts Biotech Specialist (its Lander token
# arrives) and sacrifices the Lander for {2}: the token leaves, nothing else does (the Specialist stays), and at the beginning
# of the end step the Robot is created. The control that nothing leaving means no Robot is the first Elegy Acolyte scenario.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Dark Ritual
Mox Ruby
Elegy Acolyte
Biotech Specialist
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Dark Ritual.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elegy Acolyte.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Biotech Specialist.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Lander Token.Activate
Bot1.Search()
[T4 Bot2.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Jet; Mox Ruby; Mox Emerald; Mox Sapphire; Elegy Acolyte; Biotech Specialist; Robot Token
Bot1.Battlefield.Robot Token.Token = true
Bot2.Life = 18
